alert drive
===========

a system to alert drowsy drivers and keep them up

setup
-----

# clone repository
$ git clone https://github.com/virajsazzala/alert-drive.git

# step into dir
$ cd alert-drive

# make a virtual environment
$ python3 -m venv .venv

# activate virtual environment
$ source .venv/bin/activate

# install deps
$ pip install ./requirements.txt

# download pre-trained shape predictor
$ wget http://dlib.net/files/shape_predictor_68_face_landmarks.dat.bz2

Note: extract the folder and move the dat file to data/ dir

usage (under dev)
-----------------

# to detect drowsiness
$ python3 ./src/vision/detect.py

# to track logs
$ watch -n 1 tail ./eye-status.log 

Note: this project is under development, expect breaking changes

